    "tab_content_E6Fhye": {
      "type": "tab-content",
      "blocks": {
        "tab_Ktjp6B": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/image_f8de4710-ff12-4f32-9c09-01dd15d78ee9.png",
            "image_second": true,
            "tab_title": "Step 1. Order Has Been Processed",
            "title": "Step 1. Order Has Been Processed",
            "title2": "",
            "show_contact": false,
            "text": "",
            "richtext": "<p>The processing time is indicated on each product page. Transit time is additional. So, the total time to receive your order = processing time + transportation time. We have a \"Processing & Transit Time Calculator\" available on each product page which can calculate the estimated time to receive your order.</p><p>For additional reference on where your items will come from:</p><ul><li>French Fitness Equipment: 100% from Benicia, CA warehouse</li><li>Brand New Equipment (non French Fitness brand): 15% shop from Benicia, CA while the rest will be coming from other States.</li><li>Remanufactured Equipment: 80% are from Benicia, CA. 20% from other states</li></ul><p><a href=\"/pages/delivery-assembly-legal-addendum\" title=\"/pages/delivery-assembly-legal-addendum\">See shipping options</a></p>",
            "list_items": "",
            "link": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "icon": "tick",
            "image-text": "<h3>Shipping & Delivery Estimates</h3><p>Product pages show processing and fulfillment estimates when available. Shipping options and costs are calculated at checkout based on your product, delivery address, and selected service level. Delivery windows are estimates and may vary by carrier, location, weather, and other factors.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_LnteRk": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Frame_624757_34f7d9e0-4d48-46d8-a1fd-7a553ff54af1.png",
            "image_second": true,
            "tab_title": "Step 2. Order Has Been Shipped",
            "title": "Step 2. Order Has Been Shipped",
            "title2": "",
            "show_contact": false,
            "text": "",
            "richtext": "<p>Tracking information will be sent to you via email within 24 hours upon shipping. Here’s what you can expect to receive from us, based on your chosen mode of delivery:</p><ul><li>For <strong>Curbside delivery</strong> -  we’ll provide the carrier we used for shipment + the tracking number</li><li>For <strong>Room of Choice delivery</strong> - we’ll provide the carrier, tracking number, and the installer's information</li><li>For <strong>Parcel deliveries</strong> - we’ll provide you with the USPS/FedEx tracking number</li></ul>",
            "list_items": "",
            "link": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "icon": "tick",
            "image-text": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_9dyUUP": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/756bb489b00b2dcd0a8870c6a2e85105.png",
            "image_second": true,
