      ],
      "settings": {
        "title": "Room of Choice Delivery",
        "text": "Room of Choice Delivery is an optional upgrade available at checkout for select items and locations. Depending on the option you choose, it may include inside delivery to a specific room or garage, packaging removal, and equipment assembly.\n<br><br>\n\n<b>Important details and limitations apply.</b> Please review our <b><a style=\"color: #D83D0E;\" href=\"/pages/delivery-assembly-legal-addendum\">Delivery & Assembly Legal Addendum</a></b> before selecting a Room of Choice option.",
