        },
        "text_THnnfA": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>If you are located within 120 to 200 miles of our warehouse located in Benicia, CA, then we will deliver in our own trucks. And there will be no additional transportation time on top of the lead time. Simply expect a call from us when your items are ready for delivery!</p><p>In-store pickup is also available from our warehouse, with no additional charges. Just indicate your preference for pickup upon checkout.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.fitnesssuperstore.com/pages/northern-california-delivery\" target=\"_blank\">Learn more about our Northern California Delivery here.</a></p><p>Point of reference for our Northern California shipping and in-store pickup address is:</p><p></p>",
