            "title2": "",
            "show_contact": false,
            "text": "",
            "richtext": "<ul><li>Missing/damaged parts or small dents fall under this category</li><li>Sign the delivery receipt, form, or proof of delivery and indicate the words “shipping damage” next to your signature</li><li>Option to Accept or Reject Delivery? You have either option available. If you choose to accept delivery, we may coordinate replacement parts and, where applicable, available follow-up support options. If you prefer not to accept the machine in this condition, you may reject delivery and contact us to discuss next steps.</li></ul>",
